  "body": "To note, this does not seem to cause an issue with an upgrade, but generates an error with the latest package.\r\n\r\n```\r\nPreconfiguring packages ...\r\n/tmp/matrix-synapse-py3.config.BLTxSp: 8: /tmp/matrix-synapse-py3.config.BLTxSp: /opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/manage_debconf.pl: not found\r\n```\r\n\r\nWhich is odd, because the file does seem to exist after install:\r\n\r\n```$ ls -la /opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/manage_debconf.pl\r\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 root root 3145 Mar  1 03:58 /opt/venvs/matrix-synapse/lib/manage_debconf.pl\r\n```\r\n\r\nPackage info: matrix-synapse-py3::0.99.2+stretch1::amd64 \r\n\r\nThis does not seem to cause any issues on an upgrade, service started and is running without issue, may impact new installs.\r\n\r\n",
